msgid "A Site That Represents You and Wins Customers"
msgstr "Un Site Qui Vous Représente et Gagne des Clients"

msgid "Looking good isn't enough. Clear messaging, fast loading, strong SEO, and measurable actions — together, your site becomes a sales tool that works around the clock."
msgstr "Bien paraître ne suffit pas. Messagerie claire, chargement rapide, SEO fort — votre site devient un outil de vente permanent."

msgid "Why it matters"
